  "notes": "A small release: one date fix, and ChatsRecall is back on the Mac.\n\n## Highlights\n\n- :sparkles: **ChatsRecall for Mac** The Mac version is available again from the website, for Apple-chip and Intel Macs, and it updates itself from now on like the Windows version.\n\n> imported dates, Mac setup and updates\n\n## Improved\n\n- On a Mac, first-run setup finds the AI apps you have installed, and Connect an assistant offers Claude Desktop's own settings file.\n- A Mac that has no update waiting now says so, instead of showing an update error.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Conversations added with Import or from a watched folder show their real date again. Builds up to 0.1.102 saved some of them with a date far in the future; they are corrected the next time ChatsRecall opens.\n",
